  "description": {
    "text": "The Black & White Trainer Kit came out in September 2011 in English and other European languages only, after a planned 3 August release was delayed. It held two half decks, Excadrill and Zoroark, with a Black & White booster pack, a deck box, a rule book, counters, a coin and a playmat, plus a guide for each half deck. The cards are reprints from Black & White and Emerging Powers with the kit's own set symbol and no rarity mark, numbered in the order the example battle draws them; Excadrill and Zoroark have artwork different from their Emerging Powers cards. In the Pokémon Trading Card Game Online the two halves combine as the Night Hunter deck.\n\nThis set holds the Excadrill half deck."
  },
